golem.material.tr_tallow=Tallow
golem.material.text.tr_tallow=The Golem is crafted from Tallow. Therefore it's not very sturdy and moves very weird. But at least it's light.
golem.material.tr_silverwood=Silverwood
golem.material.text.tr_silverwood=The Golem is crafted from Silverwood. It's light, relatively sturdy and even capable of performing some advanced tasks. Even though it's not fire resistant.
golem.material.tr_thaumium_aer=Air Infused Thaumium
golem.material.text.tr_thaumium_aer=The Golem is crafted from Air Infused Thaumium. It's very light, in fact so light that it can fly. It also shares the same properties with Thaumium.
golem.material.tr_thaumium_ignis=Fire Infused Thaumium
golem.material.text.tr_thaumium_ignis=The Golem is crafted from Fire Infused Thaumium. It's very similar to Thaumium. However it burnes with Rage.
golem.material.tr_thaumium_aqua=Water Infused Thaumium
golem.material.text.tr_thaumium_aqua=The Golem is crafted from Water Infused Thaumium. Due to its attraction to water it's able to regenerate itself. It's also quite similar to Thaumium.
golem.material.tr_thaumium_terra=Earth Infused Thaumium
golem.material.text.tr_thaumium_terra=The Golem is crafted from Terra Infused Thaumium. Therefore it's more heavily armored than all the other types. Otherwise it's similar to Thaumium.
golem.material.tr_thaumium_ordo=Order Infused Thaumium
golem.material.text.tr_thaumium_ordo=The Golem is crafted from Order Infused Thaumium. Due to additional knowledge it's capable of handling a bigger area.
golem.material.tr_thaumium_perditio=Entropy Infused Thaumium
golem.material.text.tr_thaumium_perditio=The Golem is crafted from Entropy Infused Thaumium. It has a buring desire to break things. It is also quite similar to Thaumium.
